flowchart LR
  U[User browser] --> SPA[React SPA]
  SPA -->|HTTPS JSON + session cookie| API[Express API]
  API -->|Mongoose| DB[(MongoDB Atlas)]
  API -->|server-side key| AI[Adaption API]
  SPA -->|Web Audio API| AUDIO[Local audio file]
  SPA -. numeric metrics only .-> API
  AUDIO -. raw audio stays local .-> SPA
